TorrentDesk
Educational native Windows port inspired by JOAL.

Upstream: https://github.com/anthonyraymond/joal
Snapshot: 4f7e40d84859ef00181b5a23a5c7d5b34fa7bac3
The client profiles in profiles/ are copied without modification from upstream.
Configuration conventions and peer/key algorithms are ported from JOAL.
JOAL and its contributors retain their original rights under Apache-2.0.
TorrentDesk is an independent project and is not an official JOAL release.
Changes: native C++/Win32 UI, torrent parser, WinHTTP transport, scheduler,
persistence, tests, Windows packaging and original application artwork.

